  <item>
    <title>VOL.025她她旅行|上海，谁陪我去看的谁的演唱会</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68a14ac6293471fed4fc7ae3</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68a14ac6293471fed4fc7ae3</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 17 Aug 2025 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>她她对谈·第25期</span></p><span></span><p><span>继5月我们开始了她她旅行系列的第一期，时隔二三月，没想到那么快，就迎来了我们的第二期，本期的目的地是上海。上海对于我和钟老师都不陌生，因为它比较离杭州如此近。这个7月，我体感上钟老师每个双休好像都泡在上海，仿佛像个上海人。所以去的那么频繁，上海到底谁在阿？！！</span></p><span></span><p><span>本次，虽然本次是她她旅行第二期，但是含上海量极低，低到仿佛把上海换成任何一个城市都很合理；演唱会含量极高，真好，又是去演唱会续命的一周</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="280">04:40</a> 演唱会初印象</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="838">13:58</a> 激烈的抢票</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="956">15:56</a> 以前看演唱会和现在的不一样</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1493">24:53</a> 有趣的现场故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1846">30:46</a> 演唱会后遗症</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1962">32:42</a> 演唱会的遗憾</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2103">35:03</a> 关于陈粒演唱会</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3048">50:48</a> 彩蛋：演唱会实录&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>BGM</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>《悠长假期》——陈粒</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>关于我们</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>主播：@沈两天 @钟倾</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：@钟倾</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>联系我们</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>微信：yuki961010</span></p><span></span><p><span>新浪微博@沈两天</span></p><span></span><p><span>PS：一些演唱会照片以及返程的窗外</span></p><span></span><p><span>《她的嘉宾》</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpLHeibrNMQ9f9dO13LsTEuU4OHa.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>《果实》</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fgy2A3BmuucF2NuxGwu9AlLkR0l5.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>最爱的歌词：天亮了天晴了，事情就会解决</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqpdYkzuvh2nBetI0pwauVjzejz7.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>《最爱的舞美造型》</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fq3J3BTjXn6SDhe8jt9Eg-2ksd1x.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>《返程的雨天窗外》</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fg_DX21t73ARIlp1FxNPwBFVCHBI.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
