  <item>
    <title>VOL.021 算命！上香！聊星座！算塔罗！当代年轻人的另类&quot;谋生&quot;手段</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6857df9e4abe6e29cb6370f4</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6857df9e4abe6e29cb6370f4</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 22 Jun 2025 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>她她对谈·第21期</span></p><span></span><p><span>听说当你上班时，你的工位布局应该左边放小风扇，右边放水杯，这样才能风！生！水！起！</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果要为什么，我只能说，没！错！了！本期我们想聊的话题是玄学。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期特别郑重声明：本期的发言没有什么科学依据，可能都是胡说八道。接下来我们提到的一些说法，玄学效果因人而异。最后，作为社会主义接班人，我们还是提倡大家相信科学，且不用利用玄学手段做伤害自己伤害他人的事。</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>收听指南</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="49">00:00:49</a> 办公室玄学</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="841">00:14:01</a> 一些玄学暗示的场合</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="986">00:16:26</a> 一切都是最好的安排</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1667">00:27:47</a> 一些星座黑话</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2083">00:34:43</a> 对巨蟹和天秤的描述准吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2902">00:48:22</a> 算算塔罗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3177">00:52:57</a> 花絮小彩蛋</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>BGM</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>《八方来财》——揽佬</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>关于我们</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>主播：@沈两天 @钟倾</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：@钟倾</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>联系我们</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>微信：yuki961010</span></p><span></span><p><span>新浪微博@沈两天</span></p>]]></description>
