    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>她她对谈·第19期</span></p><span></span><p><span>这里是她她对谈之她她旅行分频道，我们要出发去！成！都！啦！</span></p><span></span><p><span>后续我们可能专门会开设一个系列，用声音的方式去记录我们在旅行过程中的所见所闻所感。</span></p><span></span><p><span>先叠个甲，由于本次我们可能是线下实时录制的关系，可能音质上会存在一些遗憾；因为是闲聊，表达上可能也会一些逻辑上的混乱。提前请大家谅解~</span></p><span></span><p><span>ok，废话不多说，让我们进入正题吧。</span></p><span></span><p><span>收听指南</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="31">00:00:31</a> 萧山机场的会晤</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="414">00:06:54</a> 落地成都啦</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="694">00:11:34</a> 谁能在一家咖啡馆里面品味3种醋和一盒酱油？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="826">00:13:46</a> 忽然看到的热锅串串</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1008">00:16:48</a> 看剧——遇见天府</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1408">00:23:28</a> 彪悍的交通</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1611">00:26:51</a> 音乐节的期待</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2169">00:36:09</a> 一句话安利成都</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM</span></p><span></span><p><span>《旅行的意义》——陈绮贞</span></p><span></span><p><span>《成都》——赵雷</span></p><span></span><p><span>关于我们</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：@沈两天 @钟倾</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：@钟倾</span></p><span></span><p><span>联系我们</span></p><span></span><p><span>微信：yuki961010</span></p><span></span><p><span>新浪微博@沈两天</span></p>]]></description>
